        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hesekiya sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweaydeaba samwagu bea sugoocheanduumeeda Hosheya orjeeda Ela was sugoocheanda Israeli. Hean ghoang'eat sugoocheanda Yuda Hesekiya was orjeeda Ahasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda ghoang'eat sugoocheanduumeeda nea gaba gweanyeew diktam ea muut. Ak ghwaak gweanyeew diktam ea shageash aba Yerusalemu, ak gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Abiya was hudeaba Sakariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin gea miyaasiin aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, gawuurji gidaghayi sinda ghwaan was Dawdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwanyarja hooweani sibadiini ghadooweedean, nea ghafwakta daranajeega, nea gwalaksa ng'eanyi Ashera. Ak gwahirjeaweada ea ghoah banajanga ichibooda oormeeda oomu ghayi sin Musa, aba gideaba eara aba damandida fuga Israeli gwajoohiisa geediga sing'andita, ak gaguura Nehushtani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niny ghaghus NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli, ak ea manda dea uurji niny aba jeeda sugoodiga sean bea Yuda eara geaghayi mida madeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba niny ghwaat geeshta NG'UTAMIIDA nea miighwanung'waada eata geeshta, ak ghoang'waay digheanyeeka atamanamughuush ghayi rukusa NG'UTAMIIDA Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwandeay sea NG'UTAMIIDA, nea hiji nyooh gawa sean ghwanyas gheamamda miy. Ak ghaheawa ng'asheega sugoocheanda Ashuru, ak ea miigagadiyeesa niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghabwar fuga Filisti ea ghwahita Gaasa ea moonghajeagaaschi, ghang'eada madalooda furiischoodiga ea ghwahita mujiineeda sineaweesa ghamarda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba ang'wan bea sugoocheanduumeeda Hesekiya, nea gweaydeaba ispwa gil bea sugoocheanduumeeda Hosheya orjeeda Ela, was sugoocheanda Israeli. Hean ghwascheang'da Shalmanesa was sugoocheanda Ashuru gang'uchi sea Samariya hean gwaneaweesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gweanyeew samwagu ghoang'waay fuga Ashuru Samariya nea gweaydeaba lah gil bea Hesekiya was gweaydeaba shageash bea sugoocheanduumeeda Hosheya was sugoocheanda Israeli abeeda geang'waay Samariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu goobaleak sugoocheanda Ashuru fuga Israeli ea ghwahita Ashuru. Ak ghwanung' goobiida mujiineeda Hala ea Habori neekeewa eenda Gosani ea mujiinajeega fuga Meedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea mii gooleeysiit NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA nyaawa nea ghwaramwas neajeadaanyi. Ea ng'asheega sean ghayi rukusa Musa was siida gadiyeeda NG'UTAMIIDA gideaba adooleeysiit nea adoosinyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga Ashuru ning'uda muuwda Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba damanang'wan bea sugoocheanduumeeda Hesekiya. Hean ghwascheang'da Senakeribu was sugoocheanda Ashuru gang'uchi sea mujiinajeega sean bea Yuda sineaweesa ghamarda, ak ghwajoar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean Hesekiya was sugoocheanda Yuda, goojeakta buuneeda gaweay Lakishi heeda sugoocheanda Ashuru, ak gwayeesha, “Neadiinyi nung'waadanaan biikta gaydagoonyi gidigasayi sean.” Hean ghwaaga ghoorjooda sugoocheanda Ashuru Hesekiya was sugoocheanda Yuda dalaantaji bughaji samwagu bea lapiya ea dalaantaji diktam ea damanamughuush bea dahaabu siguura dahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoadayda Hesekiya lapiyeesean mida jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ea gea mida heesiitiiwiisa haleanjeeda gheeda sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba damandida Hesekiya gageanda dahaabu siguura dahaabu mida ghuuta gheeda sibata NG'UTAMIIDA, ea uhuuda daranajeega ghayi iin Hesekiya was sugoocheanda Yuda dahaabu siguura dahaabu, ak ghoadaw sugoocheanda Ashuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu goojeakta sugoocheanda Ashuru shirikarajeanda haw ea siida haw ambal fuga sigul, ea shirikarajeanda haw ambal lugooda, ea lugoosaang'a. Ak ghang'eada Lakishi ak gaweay ea ghwahita Yerusalemu heeda Hesekiya was sugoocheanda. Hean geascheang'da ea eahita Yerusalemu. Nea geahita, geeweay ak geamiinaada nea neekeewa dabascheanda beega, mida naweeda bareanda gal heeda siihuuna hang'weaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea geeguursa sugoochean, hean gwardu jarooda Eliyakimu was orjeeda Hilkiya was siida haw ambal gheeda sugoocheanda, ea Shebina was ng'oorshoocheanda, ea Yoa orjeeda Asafu, was ng'oorshoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda shirikarajeandida haw ambal lugoodean ak gwayeesha saawa, “Asi ayeeshiina Hesekiya gideaba ‘Gwayi sugoocheanda haw bea Ashuru, ghusooni ikghusiin naaha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'iing'i girgu ak ea ng'asheega mwadaagha gil, gideaba gwanda ng'asheega, ak gwanda uurda ng'ucheeda. Ak ghamneawa gighusi ng'eaha ea heawanaan aniini? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'ula ang'iing'i ghamneawa gighusi fuga Misri uurji bileangida giinyeat bea diigheecheanda, nea siida nyas ghaghus gayghang'ut geatinda ak nih giduurji Farao gil was sugoocheanda Misri, aba fuga sean ghus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea inyas gooyeenyi, “Geaghuschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA.” Neada ea mii dea ghayi nyarja Hesekiya heeda sibadiin ghadooweeda ea heeda wagoojiga, ak gwayeesha fuga Yuda ea fuga Yerusalemu, “Gajabwada aba madeeda hiji bea wagiidean aba Yerusalemu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi abaloola sea ng'utamiideanyu, was sugoocheanda Ashuru. Ak gaydagoonyi faraasaji sagalamnyooji iyeenya, nyas gindeawi fuga jea gwading'da badahuuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak giimuustiin adealda bwadaw shirikarajeanjagi bea jeeda fuga gadiyeeda manang'i bea ng'utamiideanyu ak gibassigeaw fuga Misri gideaba eegoonyi mutukwajeega ea faraasi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heapi aniini geascheeng'u dang'uchi hiji nea ghaalaschi uhuuda nea marukunean NG'UTAMIIDA? NG'UTAMIIDA dea rukunean gil, gideaba siyeang'da una ng'ucheewana ng'eanyiita ak gilasi uhuuda.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Eliyakimu orjeeda Hilkiya, ea Shebina, ea Yoa, ak geeyeesha shirikarajeanda haw, “Eaniyean abaloola fugaagu bea gadiyeeda aba iita Ashuru, aba gideaba geanali nea adibalooli fiisu mida uhuuda ghamardean aba iita Yahudi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda shirikarajeandida ak gwayeesha saawa, “Goojeaknean siideanyu haw darukusa ng'asheesu siidaang'u haw ea ang'iing'i, mii fuga apteada aba uhuuda ghamarda gil, gea jea ghwaak fiyeega nyaawa, nea ghwali sagwaseega nyaawa?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamiinaada shirikarajeandida ak gooyeawda aba ghuuta haw aba ghuuta fuga Yahudi, nea gwayi, “Ooleeysiiniit ng'asheanda sugoocheanda haw was sugoocheanda Ashuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi sugoocheanda, ‘adagwareenganeegwa Hesekiya, aba gideaba mayghoaghuuheagwa aba geatindaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Hesekiya adagwareenganeegwa aba badayda NG'UTAMIIDA neagwayi, aba huumwa NG'UTAMIIDA gayghoaghuuheasa, nea eara mujiineani ea maygageanda sugoocheanda Ashuru.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adooleeysiit Hesekiya nih gidanyaah sugoocheanda Ashuru gil, ‘agassa hoyyoo aba heedeanyu ak ghoapkaanyi heedeanyu; daba siisi ak haghweega sabiiboadaanyi, ea haghweega meaghayeandaanyi, nea gaba siisi leah beega healadeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwak ea dahidu ak ghaayaadeegwa ng'eanyiida uurji ng'eanyiideang'wa, ng'eanyiida mida booga ea difaayi ng'eanyiida mida mukaate ea madameega sabiibu, ng'eanyiida mida geediga saytuunajeega, ea maleeda jea oopiidana ea moomeewi. Ak ea adoolleeysiit Hesekiya reenganeegwa nea gwayi, NG'UTAMIIDA gayghoaghuuheasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heapi gwanda aseecheeka eemoojiga niweat fugaaschi eara eaweecheanjagi aba geatinda sugoocheanda Ashuru? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwanda yeenu aseecheeka Hamati, ea gea Arpadi? Gwanda yeenu aseecheeka Sefarfaimu, ea gea Hena, ea gea Ifa? Heapi nighu Samariya aba geatindeanyu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeeda aseecheeka sean bea darooraka gwanda dea nighu darooraka nyaawa aba geatindeanyu; meakghusa ghoaghu NG'UTAMIIDA Yerusalemu aba geatindeanyu?’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
